# Line endings are LF in this repository, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a checkout on Windows with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every
# text file to CRLF: the shell scripts then fail at their shebang
# ("/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory"), check.sh cannot run
# inside WSL, and a file edited there and committed comes back as a
# whole-file rewrite. Declaring the files text with eol=lf makes git
# normalise on commit and check out LF regardless of the local setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
